No matter what equipment you have, there's one rule of thumb always to
remember when entering the BigRoom level:
Stay on the stairs where you entered th level, and kill the wandering
monsters standing there. Retreat upstairs to heal whenever you feel like
getting low on Hp. 
Sometimes it is a good idea to do that after every monster killed.
When there are no more (or not many) monsters moving in your sight, and
you are copletely healed, THEN you move yourself and clear the rest of
the level.

